00:21:20,168 --> 00:21:22,168
Do any of the older students call you "chan"?

527
00:21:22,168 --> 00:21:24,168
No, I call her Ayame.

528
00:21:24,168 --> 00:21:28,168
I think we talk more casually.

529
00:21:28,168 --> 00:21:29,168
I see.

530
00:21:29,168 --> 00:21:32,168
Why did you come to Yumiki?

531
00:21:32,168 --> 00:21:38,168
We were shooting a music video for "I Dream Twice.

532
00:21:38,168 --> 00:21:40,168
Was there a song like that?

533
00:21:40,168 --> 00:21:42,168
Please tell me.

534
00:21:42,168 --> 00:21:46,168
When we were shooting the music video for "I Dream Twice"...

535
00:21:46,168 --> 00:21:48,168
Please tell me.

536
00:21:48,168 --> 00:21:50,168
People dream twice.

537
00:21:50,168 --> 00:21:53,168
Why do you sound like a preacher?

538
00:21:53,168 --> 00:21:55,168
During the shooting of the music video

539
00:21:55,168 --> 00:21:58,168
Nagi is a bit of a modest girl.

540
00:21:58,168 --> 00:22:02,168
When she was sitting alone, if she thought I was alone

541
00:22:02,168 --> 00:22:04,168
I would go up to her and talk to her.

542
00:22:04,168 --> 00:22:07,168
I did that.

543
00:22:07,168 --> 00:22:10,168
Nagi told me that she enjoys my company.

544
00:22:10,168 --> 00:22:13,168
She told me I could talk to her without worrying about her.

545
00:22:13,168 --> 00:22:14,168
I see.

546
00:22:14,168 --> 00:22:16,168
She said she'd like to come to my house, too.

547
00:22:16,168 --> 00:22:20,168
A girl like this doesn't ask to go to someone's house.

548
00:22:20,168 --> 00:22:22,168
This kind of girl?

549
00:22:22,168 --> 00:22:23,168
What kind of girl?

550
00:22:23,168 --> 00:22:24,168
Not the type to say much the second time around.

551
00:22:24,168 --> 00:22:26,168
I know, but she said it.

552
00:22:26,168 --> 00:22:28,168
"I want to go to your house." That's a pretty big deal.It's pretty big to want to go home, isn't it?

553
00:22:28,168 --> 00:22:29,168
Sounds big.

554
00:22:29,168 --> 00:22:30,168
I don't know, Kimura-san.

555
00:22:30,168 --> 00:22:33,168
It's hard, but after listening to the whole thing...

556
00:22:33,168 --> 00:22:36,168
I don't think she wants to go home anymore.

557
00:22:36,168 --> 00:22:37,168
I'm starting to feel that.

558
00:22:37,168 --> 00:22:39,168
I thought I'd done a lot of work on the hall earlier.

559
00:22:39,168 --> 00:22:43,168
If you've got the right person, clap, if not, sorry.

560
00:22:43,168 --> 00:22:45,168
Who do you want to give your save to?

561
00:22:46,168 --> 00:22:48,168
Who is it?

562
00:22:48,928 --> 00:22:54,928
Is Inoue's true love here?

563
00:22:57,928 --> 00:22:59,928
Yes!

564
00:22:59,928 --> 00:23:01,928
Yay!

565
00:23:01,928 --> 00:23:03,928
I'm so happy!

566
00:23:04,064 --> 00:23:06,764
I'm so happy! Thank you!

567
00:23:06,764 --> 00:23:08,764
Oh, my gosh, Yoda!

568
00:23:08,764 --> 00:23:11,764
Sorry, something came up!

569
00:23:13,764 --> 00:23:21,728
So Inoue gave a year-end gift he prepared for Yoda, who loves dumplings, to express his gratitude.

570
00:23:21,728 --> 00:23:23,728
How did you do?

571
00:23:23,728 --> 00:23:30,728
I really appreciate your help in this year's tour, and I've got a new massage therapist coming in for a new term.

572
00:23:30,728 --> 00:23:35,728
Yoda-san went out of his way to create a group line for us,

573
00:23:35,728 --> 00:23:42,728
I know it's hard to go to a massage when you have seniors there, but I know you are tired, so I hope you will go.

574
00:23:42,728 --> 00:23:46,728
Wait a minute...there have been times in the past when you have created a group line, haven't there?

575
00:23:46,728 --> 00:23:51,728
Didn't Akimoto go to a lot of trouble to make a group line for this kind of project?

576
00:23:51,728 --> 00:23:59,728
No, really, I was talking with the physiologist about how the seniors were not looking good because they were getting massaged,

577
00:23:59,728 --> 00:24:04,728
I thought it would be hard for them to go if someone didn't tell them, so I did it.

578
00:24:04,728 --> 00:24:06,728
And they gave me a T-shirt.

579
00:24:06,728 --> 00:24:07,728
Oh, T-shirts.

580
00:24:07,728 --> 00:24:09,728
Yoda is into making T-shirts.

581
00:24:09,728 --> 00:24:12,728
Yoda is really into making T-shirts these days. I felt like Yoda was amazing lately.

582
00:24:12,728 --> 00:24:15,728
I told her I wanted one, and she said she made Nagi's too.

583
00:24:15,728 --> 00:24:16,728
Is that so?

584
00:24:16,728 --> 00:24:17,728
Yes, I did.

585
00:24:17,728 --> 00:24:23,728
I was so happy when she gave it to me with her message on the day of the music video.

586
00:24:23,728 --> 00:24:26,728
That's great that you took her out to dinner and so on. You are really doing something right, aren't you, senpai?

587
00:24:26,728 --> 00:24:28,728
You are doing that kind of thing, Yoda.

588
00:24:28,728 --> 00:24:33,728
No, I just felt like I had to pay back the senpai for all the things they had done for me.

589
00:24:33,728 --> 00:24:34,608
Ah.

590
00:24:34,608 --> 00:24:36,608
You could throw a party like that, couldn't you? Let's have it at our place.

591
00:24:36,608 --> 00:24:37,608
I'd love to.

592
00:24:37,608 --> 00:24:38,608
That sounds great.

593
00:24:38,608 --> 00:24:39,608
Sorry, Yuki.

594
00:24:39,608 --> 00:24:40,608
It's okay.

595
00:24:40,608 --> 00:24:42,608
I wanted to go with you first.

596
00:24:42,608 --> 00:24:43,608
No, you can't. No, you can't.

597
00:24:43,608 --> 00:24:45,608
Please, those who lost, go back.

598
00:24:45,608 --> 00:24:46,608
Please return.

599
00:24:46,608 --> 00:24:48,608
Please don't learn from this and come back.

600
00:24:48,608 --> 00:24:49,608
Please come back.

601
00:24:51,608 --> 00:24:54,608
The product outline for the 34th single has been determined.

602
00:24:55,608 --> 00:24:59,608
Tickets for Shinyama Mono live streaming and viewing are now on sale.

603
00:25:00,608 --> 00:25:02,608
Hi, I'm Rika Sato.

604
00:25:02,608 --> 00:25:04,608
I've been working hard on stage recently.

605
00:25:04,608 --> 00:25:10,608
I will do my best on stage and in Nogichu with this twintail Wadagaki-chan hair.

606
00:25:10,608 --> 00:25:13,608
Please subscribe to my channel.
